  "sdo:name": "RCE Beeldbank images linked to STM places",
  "sdo:description": "Static snapshot of images from the Beeldbank of the Rijksdienst voor het Cultureel Erfgoed (RCE linked data, dataset rce/afbeeldingen) with a Surinamese address, each linked once to the most specific STM location (1885 address point > street 1885 > street 1916 > place). Links are proposals; building-level links assume RCE house numbers follow the 1921/2022 numbering (via Concordans Paramaribo) and must be checked. Re-run scripts/rce_beeldbank/build_rce_images.py to refresh.",
  "sdo:license": "Images: CC BY-SA (per item, see license); metadata: RCE",
